# ER (exact resume P0, docs/tp4-exact-resume.md 5.2): a committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a
# throwaway commit of tp4/exact-resume and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job). Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-er-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-er-1/<tag>/' *.env). The twins (-fx-all-er, -fx-all-er-audit) are
# placed in qwen_c2_profiles.json by WP0 from scripts/ci/fusion-wp/ER.json (make_fusion_profiles.py --write); until then the templates naming them do not pass c2_serving_job.py's profile check.
# The cards serve production: the owner stops the node agent and unserves production BEFORE X0 and restores it after Z (the cutover pack's steps and post-checks); nothing here does either.
# ERX (STOP; the COLD-TWIN PAIRS): the prefix gate's exact-resume plan (prefix_replay.scenario_exact_resume) on the audited twin: three conversations whose first prompts are ~9k, ~33k and ~120k
# tokens, then six returning tool turns each of 150, 400, 900, 1700, 2600 and 300 new tokens; every turn a cold run under a fresh salt and the hit under the conversation's salt, compared token for token
# (strict), the oracle's Q strict (prefix_judge.Oracle with the undrop and the carry: a carried resume above P - 2048 wherever the new content stays under 2048 - (P mod 2048)). READ: the plan PASS:
# every pair IDENTICAL; every continuation's Q the oracle's (none above it; under it only with an eviction on record); exact_resume_findings: the engaged line with undrop=1 carry=1, at least one
# carried admission, every window carry audit line exact=True (the carried rows read back as stored) and every cold/hit pair's two window digests EQUAL (the hit's spliced drafter window is the cold
# twin's byte for byte); no program growth after the warm. ANY difference is NO-GO. Duration (estimate): 50 minutes (the ~120k conversation's cold twins dominate: seven ~40 s cold prefills).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-er-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=exact-resume
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-er-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
